---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout markdownUrl="/privacy.md">
  <main>
    <section class="max-w-2xl mx-auto px-6 pt-12 pb-12">
      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-[120px_1fr] gap-x-6 gap-y-2 sm:gap-y-1">
        <h1 class="self-start font-mono text-sm text-gray-500 dark:text-gray-400 pt-0.5">Privacy</h1>
        <div class="flex flex-col gap-4 text-gray-700 dark:text-gray-300 leading-relaxed">
          <p>
            This is a static personal portfolio site. There's no login, no user accounts, and no
            forms on this site that collect personal information. This page describes exactly what
            does happen when you visit.
          </p>

          <div>
            <p class="text-gray-900 dark:text-gray-100 mb-2">What this site does not do:</p>
            <ul class="flex flex-col gap-1 list-disc list-inside">
              <li>No analytics or ad-tracking scripts of any kind</li>
              <li>No cookies set by this site's own code</li>
              <li>No account creation, and no forms that submit personal data</li>
            </ul>
          </div>

          <div>
            <p class="text-gray-900 dark:text-gray-100 mb-2">Third-party requests this site makes:</p>
            <ul class="flex flex-col gap-2 list-disc list-inside">
              <li>
                <span class="text-gray-900 dark:text-gray-100">Google Fonts</span> — page loads
                fonts from fonts.gstatic.com. Google may log standard request data (e.g. IP
                address) under its own privacy policy.
              </li>
              <li>
                <span class="text-gray-900 dark:text-gray-100">"Now" widget</span> — the footer's
                reading/climbing status is read from a public, read-only Supabase table. No visitor
                data is sent or stored.
              </li>
              <li>
                <span class="text-gray-900 dark:text-gray-100">Spotify now-playing widget</span> —
                the footer polls a small proxy service to show what's currently playing. It doesn't
                collect or store visitor data.
              </li>
              <li>
                <span class="text-gray-900 dark:text-gray-100">Hosting</span> — this site is
                served by GitHub Pages, which logs standard web server access data under GitHub's
                own privacy statement.
              </li>
            </ul>
          </div>

          <p>
            If this changes (for example, a newsletter signup or analytics is added later), this
            page will be updated to reflect it. Questions about this policy can go to the same
            address on the <a
              href="/contact"
              class="underline underline-offset-2 hover:text-gray-900 dark:hover:text-gray-100">Contact</a
            > page.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>
  </main>
</Layout>
